==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{p|Latias}} and {{p|Latios}} are revealed to  be helping {{adv|Emerald}}.
* [[Noland]] investigates the rental Pokémon. He is struck unconscious by an [[Guile Hideout|armored man]].
* The armored man finds out that Emerald is hampering with the completion of his plans.
* The [[Frontier Brain]]s and [[Todd Snap|reporter]] learn of what happened to Noland. 
* Emerald reveals that his task is to capture {{adv|Jirachi}}.
* Emerald attempts to capture Jirachi in [[Artisan Cave]], but is stopped by Guile Hideout.
* Jirachi and Guile flee.
* It is revealed that [[Scott]] knew about Guile Hideout and Jirachi.
* Scott reveals that {{adv|Professor Oak}} sent Emerald to the Battle Frontier.
* {{adv|Ruby}} and {{adv|Sapphire}} set sail towards the Battle Frontier.
* [[Mr. Briney]] sails on a ship that holds the statues of {{adv|Red}}, {{adv|Blue}}, {{adv|Green}}, {{adv|Yellow}}, and {{adv|Silver}}.

